# Provider credentials for agentrt.
#
# WHERE THIS FILE GOES. agentrt reads configuration from, in order:
#
#   1. the process environment
#   2. <state-dir>/.env       <- the home for an installed copy
#   3. a .env beside this file, if you are working in a checkout
#
# The state directory is %LOCALAPPDATA%\agentrt on Windows and ~/.agentrt
# elsewhere; `agentrt config` prints the exact path. Prefer (2): it is the
# only location that does not assume a particular checkout exists, and it
# keeps the credential out of any repository an agent session might be
# pointed at.
#
# The daemon promotes these into a named LLM profile in the state directory,
# so the key is never sent to Claude Code or Codex, and dispatch carries only
# a profile id.
#
# ONE CANONICAL COMBO. These three neutral names are the only spelling to
# use going forward -- set all three, always together, never mixed with the
# legacy AGENTRT_9ROUTER_* aliases below in the same file. AgentRT is
# router-neutral (docs/plans/omniroute-migration.md): it calls whatever
# single endpoint and model these three name, and does not choose, rotate or
# fall back between providers itself. Point them at a router (OmniRoute,
# 9Router, or none) or at a provider directly -- AgentRT's own behavior does
# not change either way.

AGENTRT_API_KEY=
# A router's own local endpoint (OmniRoute's default shape shown here), or a
# provider's direct endpoint (e.g. https://api.deepseek.com).
AGENTRT_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:20128/v1

# The model id exactly as AGENTRT_BASE_URL's own server expects it -- a
# router's opaque virtual model name (e.g. OmniRoute's own worker alias), or
# a real provider model id when pointed directly at a provider. AgentRT adds
# the `openai/` transport prefix itself when building the LLM profile; do
# not include it here.
AGENTRT_DEFAULT_MODEL=agentrt-worker

# Legacy aliases for AGENTRT_API_KEY/AGENTRT_BASE_URL remain accepted for
# migration only. Do not set these alongside the neutral names above -- pick
# one spelling per file, never both with different values:
# AGENTRT_9ROUTER_API_KEY=
# AGENTRT_9ROUTER_BASE_URL=
